@startuml
title JKsur+ Smart Inventory Management System\nCustomer Activity Diagram

skinparam shadowing false

|Customer|
start
:Open the web application;

|Web Application|
:Display the public shop showcase;

repeat
  |Customer|
  :View and browse products;
  :Optionally search products;
  :Optionally filter by category;
  :Optionally set a maximum budget;

  |Web Application|
  :Display products matching the search and filters;
repeat while (Continue browsing or adjusting filters?) is (yes) not (no)

stop
@enduml
